# Publish lexmora-api + lexmora-webui on Irancell-T3

Date: 2026-08-12

## Stacks

| Stack | Domain | Backend | Image |
|-------|--------|---------|-------|
| lexmora | lexmora-api.xaigrok.ir | lexmora-api:8080 | lexmora-api:latest |
| lexmora-webui | lexmora.xaigrok.ir | lexmora-webui:80 | lexmora-webui:latest |

## Deploy

- Preflight: DNS `lexmora.xaigrok.ir` and `lexmora-api.xaigrok.ir` → `2.144.27.74`; HAProxy Up; ports 80/443 listening
- Fixed PowerShell parse error in `run-on-docker-server.ps1` (unicode arrow in Write-Ok string)
- Deployed API: `lexmora-api\.armin\docker-scripts\run-on-docker-server.ps1`
- Deployed WebUI: `lexmora-webui\.armin\docker-scripts\run-on-docker-server.ps1`
- Containers: `lexmora-pgsql` (healthy), `lexmora-api`, `lexmora-webui` on `t3-net`

## TLS (Let's Encrypt)

- `lexmora.xaigrok.ir` — issuer Let's Encrypt (YE2), valid through Oct 22 2026
- `lexmora-api.xaigrok.ir` — issuer Let's Encrypt (YE1), valid through Oct 22 2026
- SoftEther `ovpbackup.xaigrok.ir` — passthrough OK (non-LE cert on TCP route)

## Verify

- `GET /api/v1/health` → 200
- `https://lexmora.xaigrok.ir/` → 200
- `POST /api/v1/auth/login` via web proxy → 200
- Public curl from ARMIN-DESKTOP → 200

